(6044708, 889264, 43565, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.</td>', 'Nice abstract.', '2010-06-07 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6044709, 888369, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is horribly mangled :-( I''m sorry but I have to say that... This is one of the great views of the world, and it''s just been *destroyed* by overprocessing. It''s flat, totally lacks the natural depth the shadows should give it.  The clouds are like they''ve been painted in with a large, featureless brush, and the WATERFALL! The waterfall''s been made to glow with this eerie brightness... It''s the ONLY thing in the image with NO color, and it''s brighter by a full stop than anything else. There''s no way the waterfall, in shadow, could be brighter than the clouds, in full sunlight.<br/> <br/>I''m sorry to be so harsh, but I spent a lot of time in Yosemite, I used to teach there, and this hits me at a visceral level :-(</td>', 'This is horribly mangled :-( I''m sorry but I have to say that... This is one of the great views of the world, and it''s just been *destroyed* by overprocessing. It''s flat, totally lacks the natural depth the shadows should give it.  The clouds are like they''ve been painted in with a large, featureless brush, and the WATERFALL! The waterfall''s been made to glow with this eerie brightness... It''s the ONLY thing in the image with NO color, and it''s brighter by a full stop than anything else. There''s no way the waterfall, in shadow, could be brighter than the clouds, in full sunlight. I''m sorry to be so harsh, but I spent a lot of time in Yosemite, I used to teach there, and this hits me at a visceral level :-(', '2010-06-07 12:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6044715, 889277, 43565, '<td valign="top">Lovely detail and texture. Enough stem and leaves to prevent the flower from floating but subtle enough to not be a distraction.</td>', 'Lovely detail and texture. Enough stem and leaves to prevent the flower from floating but subtle enough to not be a distraction.', '2010-06-07 12:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
