(6047091, 888794, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very effective.</td>', 'Very effective.', '2010-06-08 20:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047097, 887234, 23484, '<td valign="top">The HDR worked very well on this.</td>', 'The HDR worked very well on this.', '2010-06-08 20:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047108, 888914, 79955, '<td valign="top">A good subject to do a HDR. The editing could be improved. Currently I notice a lot of HDR artifacts that needs to be corrected. Example the weird color hues in the trees making it look like fringing. Composition wise looks too static . 5</td>', 'A good subject to do a HDR. The editing could be improved. Currently I notice a lot of HDR artifacts that needs to be corrected. Example the weird color hues in the trees making it look like fringing. Composition wise looks too static . 5', '2010-06-08 20:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047113, 888762, 79955, '<td valign="top">Composition wise OK , The edit can be improved though. Currently a little too yellowish overall and due to the HDR settings used the overall image is quite flat looking. Since this is advanced editing , you could actually selectively edit the appropriate parts in the shot to give it more bite. 5</td>', 'Composition wise OK , The edit can be improved though. Currently a little too yellowish overall and due to the HDR settings used the overall image is quite flat looking. Since this is advanced editing , you could actually selectively edit the appropriate parts in the shot to give it more bite. 5', '2010-06-08 21:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047158, 888989, 101445, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see both toys fully in the frame. The cutting off of their edges annoys me some, other nicely excuted</td>', 'I would have liked to see both toys fully in the frame. The cutting off of their edges annoys me some, other nicely excuted', '2010-06-08 21:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047261, 889254, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Detroit.</td>', 'Nice shot of Detroit.', '2010-06-08 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047264, 888997, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this.</td>', 'I like the colors in this.', '2010-06-08 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047266, 889049, 94235, '<td valign="top">The subtle tones and softness make this a great shot. The sky adds along with the various shades of the foliage and the main subject''s splash of color in the middle. Well composed and processed.</td>', 'The subtle tones and softness make this a great shot. The sky adds along with the various shades of the foliage and the main subject''s splash of color in the middle. Well composed and processed.', '2010-06-08 22:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047267, 889091, 94235, '<td valign="top">Love the crispness and the color you have achieved here. Well framed and a subtle use of HDR make this one a high scorer for me. Well done.</td>', 'Love the crispness and the color you have achieved here. Well framed and a subtle use of HDR make this one a high scorer for me. Well done.', '2010-06-08 22:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047269, 889091, 23484, '<td valign="top">The HDR worked very well here.</td>', 'The HDR worked very well here.', '2010-06-08 22:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047270, 889193, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice job.</td>', 'Nice job.', '2010-06-08 22:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047294, 888849, 94235, '<td valign="top">A great subject for this type of processing. Suits the challenge to a tee and should score well. Good job.</td>', 'A great subject for this type of processing. Suits the challenge to a tee and should score well. Good job.', '2010-06-08 23:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047296, 888937, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well captured. I feel as though I''m spying on the landscape from my own little hiding space. Lovely subtle colors and well processed.</td>', 'Well captured. I feel as though I''m spying on the landscape from my own little hiding space. Lovely subtle colors and well processed.', '2010-06-08 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047299, 888201, 94235, '<td valign="top">The depth in this capture is amazing. A great capture and well processed. On second look I just bumped your score up 1.</td>', 'The depth in this capture is amazing. A great capture and well processed. On second look I just bumped your score up 1.', '2010-06-08 23:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047311, 888846, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely depth, tones and perspective. Well processed.</td>', 'Lovely depth, tones and perspective. Well processed.', '2010-06-08 23:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047315, 888970, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture and well processed. I may have cropped slightly tighter on the right side to exclude a little of the wall which tends to draw my eye away from the beauty of the waterfall.</td>', 'Lovely capture and well processed. I may have cropped slightly tighter on the right side to exclude a little of the wall which tends to draw my eye away from the beauty of the waterfall.', '2010-06-08 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047318, 889257, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good capture and a nice amount of post processing. Good job.</td>', 'Good capture and a nice amount of post processing. Good job.', '2010-06-08 23:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047393, 889079, 79955, '<td valign="top">Wonderful landscape shot !! Excellent HDR processing. 8</td>', 'Wonderful landscape shot !! Excellent HDR processing. 8', '2010-06-08 23:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047395, 889278, 79955, '<td valign="top">excellent composition, excellent HDR processing. very calming shot. 8</td>', 'excellent composition, excellent HDR processing. very calming shot. 8', '2010-06-09 00:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047398, 888789, 79955, '<td valign="top">slightly tighter crop on the left would be preferred. Just a tad overprocessed making it look a little unnatural (yup sorry I am from the natural look camp. Still well done with nice details overall , 7</td>', 'slightly tighter crop on the left would be preferred. Just a tad overprocessed making it look a little unnatural (yup sorry I am from the natural look camp. Still well done with nice details overall , 7', '2010-06-09 00:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047403, 888372, 79955, '<td valign="top">HDR nicely used to give a very unique look &amp; feel, I like that. The grass though is a little too distracting. Wish you had selectively toned down the grass but focused more on the details of the door to really make it pop. 6</td>', 'HDR nicely used to give a very unique look & feel, I like that. The grass though is a little too distracting. Wish you had selectively toned down the grass but focused more on the details of the door to really make it pop. 6', '2010-06-09 00:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047409, 888176, 79955, '<td valign="top">You definitely get penalized for the edit especially the obvious halo. Composition wise it is good. Not sure how your originals were exposed , but the scene can potentially look a lot better with an improved edit. 5</td>', 'You definitely get penalized for the edit especially the obvious halo. Composition wise it is good. Not sure how your originals were exposed , but the scene can potentially look a lot better with an improved edit. 5', '2010-06-09 00:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047411, 888283, 79955, '<td valign="top">Cool shot! Really like it. The white (now gray) shoes spoilt the shot a little, but othewise love it. 8</td>', 'Cool shot! Really like it. The white (now gray) shoes spoilt the shot a little, but othewise love it. 8', '2010-06-09 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047413, 889257, 79955, '<td valign="top">the composition employed here does not make it interesting. Try to include some additional foreground interest , maybe position the fountain in a more asymmetrical position, etc. 5</td>', 'the composition employed here does not make it interesting. Try to include some additional foreground interest , maybe position the fountain in a more asymmetrical position, etc. 5', '2010-06-09 00:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047419, 888933, 79955, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a little more blacks to bring out the texture of the plough even more !! Pretty unique shot. 6</td>', 'Would have liked a little more blacks to bring out the texture of the plough even more !! Pretty unique shot. 6', '2010-06-09 00:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047420, 889271, 114285, '<td valign="top">Wow, cool pic, of something, that''s not actually very interesting, but you''ve made it look awesome.</td>', 'Wow, cool pic, of something, that''s not actually very interesting, but you''ve made it look awesome.', '2010-06-09 00:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047424, 888159, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cool pic. Love the sky, and the silver water.</td>', 'Cool pic. Love the sky, and the silver water.', '2010-06-09 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047425, 888179, 79955, '<td valign="top">I love this shot , really suitable for HDR , but I feel that our edit could be improved further. The edit on the sky and the car could definitely be improved. Currently it had lost contrast and looks too flat as the whites are missing to a certain extent. IMO the crop is also a touch too tight. 7</td>', 'I love this shot , really suitable for HDR , but I feel that our edit could be improved further. The edit on the sky and the car could definitely be improved. Currently it had lost contrast and looks too flat as the whites are missing to a certain extent. IMO the crop is also a touch too tight. 7', '2010-06-09 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047426, 888957, 79955, '<td valign="top">very natural edit. Missing the "special" lighting to really score well. 7</td>', 'very natural edit. Missing the "special" lighting to really score well. 7', '2010-06-09 00:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047427, 888367, 79955, '<td valign="top">Excellent technique. I really like the overall presentation, impact in this portrait. Nice , 7</td>', 'Excellent technique. I really like the overall presentation, impact in this portrait. Nice , 7', '2010-06-09 00:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6047428, 889274, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cool pic, could be a winner.</td>', 'Cool pic, could be a winner.', '2010-06-09 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
