(6049704, 888767, 79955, '<td valign="top">nice and crisp, a very good edit. 6 , unfortunately the overall scene does not really blow me away.</td>', 'nice and crisp, a very good edit. 6 , unfortunately the overall scene does not really blow me away.', '2010-06-10 05:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6049705, 889221, 79955, '<td valign="top">actually this is a tough shot to do a HDR as the cyclist is constantly in motion. It would impact the crispness of the main subject which currently seems to be the problem with this image. If this was the case , then one way around it is to do a psedo HDR (combining images with different exposure settings from a single original shot) , 6</td>', 'actually this is a tough shot to do a HDR as the cyclist is constantly in motion. It would impact the crispness of the main subject which currently seems to be the problem with this image. If this was the case , then one way around it is to do a psedo HDR (combining images with different exposure settings from a single original shot) , 6', '2010-06-10 05:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
