(6054463, 888307, 112828, '<td valign="top">Nice dead ass squirrel..  I''m curious how it tasted.. ;0 <i>(never drink and post...)<br/></i> <br/> <br/>Maybe it is still alive and simply climbing a tree?  Hmm... Maybe... I''m not however, convinced it''s not flattened.. <br/> <br/>So, this has to be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=50695" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">posthumous</a> or one of his crew...  So do tell, how the heck is this HDR??  I think you might have gotten more range directly out of the camera....<br/> <br/>Still, I like that you took a (rather nice) picture of a flat? squirrel and entered it...  You get a 7 today, for sheer balls and artistic vision..<br/> <br/>P.S. Seriously, how the hell do you justify entering this as HDR, I have to know, hopefully my 7 will compel you to talk.. :)</td>', 'Nice dead ass squirrel..  I''m curious how it tasted.. ;0 (never drink and post...)  Maybe it is still alive and simply climbing a tree?  Hmm... Maybe... I''m not however, convinced it''s not flattened..  So, this has to be  posthumous or one of his crew...  So do tell, how the heck is this HDR??  I think you might have gotten more range directly out of the camera.... Still, I like that you took a (rather nice) picture of a flat? squirrel and entered it...  You get a 7 today, for sheer balls and artistic vision.. P.S. Seriously, how the hell do you justify entering this as HDR, I have to know, hopefully my 7 will compel you to talk.. :)', '2010-06-13 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054465, 888194, 112828, '<td valign="top">I love your title, and would have loved just a bit less saturation and a bit more dynamic range (looks like you lost the detail in the shadow..)..<br/> <br/>Darn shame.. Still a well deserved 7</td>', 'I love your title, and would have loved just a bit less saturation and a bit more dynamic range (looks like you lost the detail in the shadow..).. Darn shame.. Still a well deserved 7', '2010-06-13 23:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054466, 888959, 112828, '<td valign="top">What a neat image!  I love this, and although I think the image is somewhat DNMC as it seems to be an artificially light single expsoure pseudo HDR, without detail in the highlights of the dress.<br/> <br/>However, with that said, I think this is superb, and absolutely deserving of the 7 I am voting it.. (darn close to an 8 though)...</td>', 'What a neat image!  I love this, and although I think the image is somewhat DNMC as it seems to be an artificially light single expsoure pseudo HDR, without detail in the highlights of the dress. However, with that said, I think this is superb, and absolutely deserving of the 7 I am voting it.. (darn close to an 8 though)...', '2010-06-13 23:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054500, 889210, 118315, '<td valign="top">If you would have gotten a tiny bit lower you could have avoided the two tangent buildings under the bridge.  Or gotten higher.</td>', 'If you would have gotten a tiny bit lower you could have avoided the two tangent buildings under the bridge.  Or gotten higher.', '2010-06-13 23:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054504, 889033, 118315, '<td valign="top">The girl''s knee should not be tangent with edge of the frame.  Someone is just peeking into the frame and with the angle of the girl''s thigh and shin you are drawn to that.  Do you really need all the space on the right?</td>', 'The girl''s knee should not be tangent with edge of the frame.  Someone is just peeking into the frame and with the angle of the girl''s thigh and shin you are drawn to that.  Do you really need all the space on the right?', '2010-06-13 23:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054505, 888238, 118315, '<td valign="top">This is another frame-within-a-frame where the frame steals the show though saturation and contrast.  The building in the back should be where the eye goes not the frame.</td>', 'This is another frame-within-a-frame where the frame steals the show though saturation and contrast.  The building in the back should be where the eye goes not the frame.', '2010-06-13 23:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054509, 888191, 118315, '<td valign="top">This should be shot from a much higher angle so you can take better advantage of the circle and spoke pattern to direct the viewer to the sculpture and cut out the trees that pull attention away.</td>', 'This should be shot from a much higher angle so you can take better advantage of the circle and spoke pattern to direct the viewer to the sculpture and cut out the trees that pull attention away.', '2010-06-13 23:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6054510, 889214, 118315, '<td valign="top">This is the correct way to do a frame within a frame.  But is this really HDR?  If so it is extremely subtle.  But it is better to err on the side of subtle than to go overboard.</td>', 'This is the correct way to do a frame within a frame.  But is this really HDR?  If so it is extremely subtle.  But it is better to err on the side of subtle than to go overboard.', '2010-06-13 23:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
