(6054537, 887550, 118315, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The lighting is subtle.  The repetition of triangles gives a dynamic feeling to this composition.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The lighting is subtle.  The repetition of triangles gives a dynamic feeling to this composition.', '2010-06-13 23:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
