(6054591, 888179, 118315, '<td valign="top">Too busy,  the car has a lot going on but the signage and pumps in the background detract.  This has enough detail for 2 images.  Maybe the car by itself and the garage by itself.</td>', 'Too busy,  the car has a lot going on but the signage and pumps in the background detract.  This has enough detail for 2 images.  Maybe the car by itself and the garage by itself.', '2010-06-13 23:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
