(6055748, 888817, 112828, '<td valign="top">I think it looks good, especially considering the equipment..<br/> <br/>I do think you might have over saturated a bit, and I think the midtones are just a bit too bright..<br/> <br/>HDR to me is more about the shadows and highlights than it is the midtones,, and your image seems to draw me consistently to the midtones.  I think that was most of the problem... <br/> <br/>But be clear... This was WAYY better than a 4.57...  you just didn''t get lucky with any fluffy white clouds, and your foliage is scary bright green.. :)</td>', 'I think it looks good, especially considering the equipment.. I do think you might have over saturated a bit, and I think the midtones are just a bit too bright.. HDR to me is more about the shadows and highlights than it is the midtones,, and your image seems to draw me consistently to the midtones.  I think that was most of the problem...  But be clear... This was WAYY better than a 4.57...  you just didn''t get lucky with any fluffy white clouds, and your foliage is scary bright green.. :)', '2010-06-14 14:40:56.000000', NULL, 0),
