(6056364, 889194, 93283, '<td valign="top">WoW.... Thanks everyone!!! I am so excited about the top ten finish... This is only the second time I''ve broken the top ten, and this score blows away my previous high score by a long shot!!!<br/> <br/>I would like to thank <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=867127" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_867127.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_867127.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96574/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_867127.jpg"/></a> For all that they have taught me... The DPL was the best learning experience I''ve had yet, and I feel like its finally paying off... SO a huge Thank You!!! to all my teammates who have helped and taught me. I look forward to the next league and hopefully I will be lucky enough to have you guys on my team again...</td>', 'WoW.... Thanks everyone!!! I am so excited about the top ten finish... This is only the second time I''ve broken the top ten, and this score blows away my previous high score by a long shot!!! I would like to thank  For all that they have taught me... The DPL was the best learning experience I''ve had yet, and I feel like its finally paying off... SO a huge Thank You!!! to all my teammates who have helped and taught me. I look forward to the next league and hopefully I will be lucky enough to have you guys on my team again...', '2010-06-14 21:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
