(6056475, 888018, 29011, '<td valign="top">Such perfection in the HDR work here. Gotta live the clean stark white range sticking out amongst the more gritter cabinets.</td>', 'Such perfection in the HDR work here. Gotta live the clean stark white range sticking out amongst the more gritter cabinets.', '2010-06-14 21:57:14.000000', NULL, 0),
