(6056516, 889092, 17507, '<td valign="top">Do you have any noise removal software like NeatImage or Noise Ninja? If not, I urge you to check out the trial versions. I was fully amazed by NeatImage when I tried it and happily shelled out the $40 or so for the full version. It can work wonders (or at least usually help!).</td>', 'Do you have any noise removal software like NeatImage or Noise Ninja? If not, I urge you to check out the trial versions. I was fully amazed by NeatImage when I tried it and happily shelled out the $40 or so for the full version. It can work wonders (or at least usually help!).', '2010-06-14 22:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
