(6057133, 888201, 30214, '<td valign="top">you made a beautiful (almost) painting out of a dull original which most of us would not bother to keep. Good job Robert, and a well deserved HM!</td>', 'you made a beautiful (almost) painting out of a dull original which most of us would not bother to keep. Good job Robert, and a well deserved HM!', '2010-06-15 16:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
