(6057311, 889192, 54563, '<td valign="top">Quintus yea it''s much nicer non hdr, I''m off to Mexico but I''ll get it up when I get back :)  I wanted to use the new photoshop hdr adjustment to see what it did, I don''t really like HDR much myself... I do like the halo on it when you are making something look fake why not pump it up and add some drama :)  Alex, I LOVE shooting through leaves and adding those blobs lol.  Thanks everyone for the comments, I think next time I want to submit something that I don''t really love I won''t, it''s no fun watching the scoring when you can''t stand behind the work!</td>', 'Quintus yea it''s much nicer non hdr, I''m off to Mexico but I''ll get it up when I get back :)  I wanted to use the new photoshop hdr adjustment to see what it did, I don''t really like HDR much myself... I do like the halo on it when you are making something look fake why not pump it up and add some drama :)  Alex, I LOVE shooting through leaves and adding those blobs lol.  Thanks everyone for the comments, I think next time I want to submit something that I don''t really love I won''t, it''s no fun watching the scoring when you can''t stand behind the work!', '2010-06-15 19:22:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6057406, 889034, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice!! I love the composition.</td>', 'Very nice!! I love the composition.', '2010-06-15 21:05:00.000000', NULL, 0),
