(6078336, 888359, 96881, '<td valign="top">Point Lonsdale Lighthouse.........<br/>Great image Terry.  Brilliant light  and clouds at the time which really does make the shot.  Like the rails snaking up to the lighthouse.  Maybe a little more space to the left would have helped a touch, and made this into a more panoramic crop.  Would have moved the lighthouse away from the extreme left.......</td>', 'Point Lonsdale Lighthouse.........Great image Terry.  Brilliant light  and clouds at the time which really does make the shot.  Like the rails snaking up to the lighthouse.  Maybe a little more space to the left would have helped a touch, and made this into a more panoramic crop.  Would have moved the lighthouse away from the extreme left.......', '2010-07-03 07:01:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(6078530, 889073, 118154, '<td valign="top">Has a real classic look and feel to it.</td>', 'Has a real classic look and feel to it.', '2010-07-03 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6087832, 889034, 60862, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this angle!  Wow, what a composition.<br/> <br/>My only suggestion would be to make the dark parts a bit blacker to enhance the contrast.  Either in levels by sliding the black point slider to the right a bit or with a selective color layer.</td>', 'I LOVE this angle!  Wow, what a composition. My only suggestion would be to make the dark parts a bit blacker to enhance the contrast.  Either in levels by sliding the black point slider to the right a bit or with a selective color layer.', '2010-07-11 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
