(6109983, 889034, 61138, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> Voters are wrong on this one.  This should be 6+. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I agree. This is a very nice piece of work. The textures, composition and balance of negative space with subject all work together to form a dynamic image. The only thing that I think it could use is a touch more contrast, to increase the dramatic tone a little.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-07-30 22:26:05.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: Voters are wrong on this one.  This should be 6+.   I agree. This is a very nice piece of work. The textures, composition and balance of negative space with subject all work together to form a dynamic image. The only thing that I think it could use is a touch more contrast, to increase the dramatic tone a little.', '2010-07-30 23:24:05.000000', '2010-07-30 23:26:05.000000', 0),
